            {
                "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                "word": "rouge",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "db6750a5-28ad-4715-be73-a817ace56263",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rouges"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac53d2b9-c03e-30cf-bd82-aa528a8f13bc",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Red or pink makeup to add colour to the cheeks; blusher."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a04c5367-2547-4c9e-8437-789c2ba6aa13",
                                "sense_id": "ac53d2b9-c03e-30cf-bd82-aa528a8f13bc",
                                "text": "Before we could embark on the details of his mother's health we were joined by a fair, plump woman of indefinite age, who had once been—and at moments still was—very pretty. She wore a simple black silk dress, perhaps in deference to Tilly's death, though the note of mourning was jarred by flamboyant aquamarine ear-rings and too much rouge."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5577a6e3-b00f-3d6c-8267-257cc4840f84",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any reddish pink colour."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cf583e90-663a-367b-9f8b-65ac6cbfae56",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A single point awarded when a team kicks the ball out of its opponent's end zone, or when a kicked ball becomes dead within the non-kicking team's end zone. Etymology uncertain; it is thought that in the early years of the sport, a red flag indicated that a single had been scored."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Canadian",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04e7294b-6dc0-317d-b989-42a6c6235e72",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the Eton wall game, a scrummage, melée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0fa632e2-4b49-4308-b01f-e611db73f544",
                                "sense_id": "04e7294b-6dc0-317d-b989-42a6c6235e72",
                                "text": "[A] wall [...] against which all those formidable \"rouges\" (as they are most underivably called) take place; in which above twenty players contend, kicking each others' shins nearly as often as the ball"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "113deae1-ca60-37a9-86fd-1208cd3652a4",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the Eton College field game, a scoring move accomplished by touching the ball down behind the opponents' goal-line (somewhat similar to the try in rugby). Originally, the player who scored the rouge had a chance to kick a goal, and the rouge was used as a tie-breaker if an equal number of goals was scored by each side. In the contemporary Eton College field game, a five-point score is awarded for kicking the ball so that it deflects off one of the opposing players and goes beyond the opposition's end of the pitch, and then touching the ball."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a09ff13-0e0e-4e14-9a5e-dd16e3c52297",
                                "sense_id": "113deae1-ca60-37a9-86fd-1208cd3652a4",
                                "text": "The 7 got 1 \"gaol\" and 1 \"ruge\"; the 11 got 1 \"gaol\" and 4 \"ruges\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc802610-5e4c-4cdd-b2d3-0d29c3b0cb13",
                                "sense_id": "113deae1-ca60-37a9-86fd-1208cd3652a4",
                                "text": "A rouge is obtained by touching the ball first, after it has been kicked behind"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a756f66e-095d-33cf-8837-12e2eb15cfdf",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "From 1862 to 1868, a similar scoring move in Sheffield rules football. From 1862 to 1867, accomplished by touching the ball down after it had been kicked between two \\\"rouge flags\\\" either side of the goal. From 1867-1868, awarded for kicking the ball between the rouge flags and under the crossbar."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "058d41c9-8ca0-41a2-b794-dd7eaf7df41a",
                                "sense_id": "a756f66e-095d-33cf-8837-12e2eb15cfdf",
                                "text": "A rouge is obtained by the player who first touches the ball after it has been kicked between the rouge flags"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "97806cf1-cb98-3c32-8534-9756836b9150",
                        "entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A red amorphous powder consisting of ferric oxide, used in polishing and as a cosmetic; crocus; jeweller's rouge."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "baf59dd1-234c-4a3d-b772-d5bb1f5e1bd1",
                        "source_entry_id": "80b94188-3f09-3d43-a1ab-cd10bd0dd894",
                        "source_sense_description": "color",
                        "target_lang_word": "Rouge",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Rouge",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29f91899-370f-3eeb-b005-c463a01c5fce",
                                        "entry_id": "4b9beaa2-11f0-3539-9916-93683f4ff8b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rotton eines Make-ups"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "189ee907-4c21-4f1c-a18d-9018b1c4a2e9",
                                                "sense_id": "29f91899-370f-3eeb-b005-c463a01c5fce",
                                                "text": "„Sie hatten ihm Rouge auf die Backen getan und die Lippen ein bißchen angemalt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76d07f22-94df-484e-a527-4ee199318a9a",
                                                "sense_id": "29f91899-370f-3eeb-b005-c463a01c5fce",
                                                "text": "„Jetzt schminkt Louise sie mit rotem Lippenstift und blauem Lidschatten, auf ihre Wangen tupft sie ein ins Orange gehendes Rouge.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "386b40ea-4a52-4075-a1fd-00eed3e8d09d",
                                                "sense_id": "29f91899-370f-3eeb-b005-c463a01c5fce",
                                                "text": "„Die Marquise war nicht da; aber zwei oder drei Minuten später kam sie aus ihrem Toilettezimmer mit sehr viel Rouge auf ihren Wangen, einer zarten Spitzenhaube, die Brust, die vierzig Jahre vor dieser Zeit wohl die schönste von Frankreich gewesen war, mit einem Umhang aus Seidenspitzen bedeckt, und in einem altmodischen, aber sehr reich mit Gold und Silber bestickten Kleid.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b54cc4f7-2e44-4433-b44b-431fad76a436",
                                                "sense_id": "29f91899-370f-3eeb-b005-c463a01c5fce",
                                                "text": "„Das Wasser stürzte in die Allongen, Kragen und Dekolletés, es wusch Puder und Rouge herunter, ein fahler Blitz riß den Garten in stoffloses Licht, und schwer prasselte der Donner hinterher.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc7b59cb-8c20-3063-a428-ba5467826e4b",
                                        "entry_id": "4b9beaa2-11f0-3539-9916-93683f4ff8b5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine der zwei Farben im Roulette"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eee1185b-ce03-402d-9785-3deec093166d",
                                                "sense_id": "bc7b59cb-8c20-3063-a428-ba5467826e4b",
                                                "text": "Mit Rouge hatte ich bisher mehr Glück."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de067afe-ca8d-4cc6-9df2-a8f0c3841e7a",
